                "text": "Early detection is one of the most powerful tools we have to slow the progression of Alzheimer's disease & related dementias.\n\nWith the support of @UsAgainstAlz, I introduced the #CHANGEAct to ensure more Americans have timely access to diagnosis and care. https://t.co/s8T1gyOZIz",
