                "text": "Today in history: The March on Washington is held on August 28, 1963.\n\nCivil rights advocates, labor leaders, and religious figures came together 59 years ago to fight for equal rights.\n\nLet us honor their legacy by continuing to push for equal treatment for all. https://t.co/c3F901lr4a",
