                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "11 years ago, our country finally ended the discriminatory \"Don't Ask, Don't Tell\" policy.\n\nIt was a historic day for equality in our military\u2014but our work is not done.\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting to ensure LGBTQ+ servicemembers receive the equal treatment they have earned and deserve.",
