                "text": "The \"model minority\" myth, language barriers, stigmas around HIV & being LGBTQI+, & fear of cultural shame often prevent AAPIs from seeking HIV treatment.\n\nOn #NAPIHAD, I\u2019m working with @EqualityCaucus and @CAPAC to address HIV & AIDS in AAPI communities. https://t.co/YKq7N9mCiR",
